msgid "ReliefMath"
msgstr "ReliefMath"

msgid ""
"ReliefMath 是原生 C++/FLTK 数学公式编辑器。一个 ``.rmath`` 文档可保存多条公式；中间编辑 LaTeX "
"源码，右侧离线渲染。程序使用系统现有的 FLTK ``gtk+`` 控件和中文字体，按 ReliefWord、ReliefExcel 的分组功能区排版。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMath is a native C++/FLTK mathematical formula editor. One ``.rmath`` "
"document can hold multiple formulas, with LaTeX source editing in the center"
" and offline rendering on the right. It uses the system's existing FLTK "
"``gtk+`` widgets and Chinese fonts, with grouped ribbons like ReliefWord and"
" ReliefExcel."

msgid "使用"
msgstr "Usage"

msgid ""
"从办公应用菜单启动，或运行 ``reliefmath "
"[document.rmath]``。左侧用于筛选、选择和管理公式；中间提供行号、命令高亮、括号匹配和源码编辑；右侧显示透明背景预览。分栏可拖动，列表与预览可在“视图”页显示或隐藏。窗口随桌面工作区调整，最小尺寸为"
" 960×600。"
msgstr ""
"Launch from the office applications menu or run ``reliefmath "
"[document.rmath]``. The left pane filters, selects, and manages formulas; "
"the center provides line numbers, command highlighting, bracket matching, "
"and source editing; the right shows a transparent-background preview. "
"Dividers are draggable, and View can show/hide the list and preview. The "
"window adapts to the desktop work area, with a minimum size of 960×600."

msgid "功能区：开始; 工具：剪贴板、公式增删改名和副本、排序、查找替换、模板、收藏、导出"
msgstr ""
"Ribbon: Home; Tools: clipboard, add/delete/rename/duplicate formulas, "
"sorting, find/replace, templates, favorites, export"

msgid "功能区：符号; 工具：希腊字母、运算与关系、箭头、集合、逻辑及完整符号目录"
msgstr ""
"Ribbon: Symbols; Tools: Greek letters, operators/relations, arrows, sets, "
"logic, and the full symbol catalog"

msgid "功能区：结构; 工具：分数、根式、上下标、积分、求和、矩阵、分段、对齐和文字向导"
msgstr ""
"Ribbon: Structures; Tools: wizards for fractions, roots, scripts, integrals,"
" sums, matrices, cases, alignment, and text"

msgid "功能区：排版; 工具：字号、行内/显示模式、颜色、边距、字体与重音"
msgstr ""
"Ribbon: Formatting; Tools: font size, inline/display mode, colors, margins, "
"fonts, and accents"

msgid "功能区：视图; 工具：缩放、适合预览、分栏显示、示例文档与帮助"
msgstr ""
"Ribbon: View; Tools: zoom, fit preview, pane visibility, sample documents, "
"and help"

msgid ""
"内置目录含 131 个插入项。结构向导生成可编辑的源码；插入后按 Tab、Shift+Tab 依次选择参数。完整支持范围见 "
"命令兼容表。这是一套离线数学子集；未知命令定位报错，不加载 TeX 宏包、文件、shell 或网络资源。"
msgstr ""
"The built-in catalog contains 131 insertion items. Structure wizards "
"generate editable source; after insertion, Tab and Shift+Tab select "
"parameters in sequence. For the full supported scope, see the command "
"compatibility table. This is an offline mathematical subset. Unknown "
"commands produce errors with source locations; TeX packages, files, shells, "
"and network resources are not loaded."

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O; 操作：新建 / 打开"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O; Action: New / Open"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+S / Ctrl+Shift+S; 操作：保存 / 另存为"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+S / Ctrl+Shift+S; Action: Save / Save As"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z; 操作：文档全局撤销 / 重做"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z; Action: Document-wide Undo / Redo"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+F / Ctrl+H; 操作：查找 / 替换"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+F / Ctrl+H; Action: Find / Replace"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+Space; 操作：命令补全"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+Space; Action: Command Completion"

msgid "快捷键：Tab / Shift+Tab; 操作：下一个 / 上一个结构参数；无参数时标准焦点导航"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Tab / Shift+Tab; Action: Next / Previous Structure Parameter; "
"Standard Focus Navigation When None Exist"

msgid ""
"源码变更经短暂合并后提交独立渲染进程。失败时保留最近成功图像，并标明“旧预览”和错误；“定位错误”选中对应源码。复制图片要求当前公式渲染成功，防止复制旧预览。PNG"
" 文件保留透明度；图片剪贴板按 FLTK 支持转换为白底 RGB。"
msgstr ""
"Source changes are briefly coalesced before submission to a separate "
"rendering process. On failure, the last successful image remains, marked "
"Stale Preview with the error. Locate Error selects the relevant source. Copy"
" Image requires successful rendering of the current formula to prevent "
"copying stale previews. PNG retains transparency; the image clipboard "
"converts to white-background RGB as supported by FLTK."

msgid "保存与导出"
msgstr "Saving and Export"

msgid ""
"原生 ``.rmath`` "
"文档保留多条公式的名称、顺序、源码和样式。保存与读取在后台执行；保存的是开始操作时的快照，期间的新编辑仍标为未保存。外部修改会要求重新加载、另存为、明确覆盖或取消。正常切换和关闭前提示处理未保存修改。"
msgstr ""
"Native ``.rmath`` documents retain multiple formulas' names, order, source, "
"and styles. Saving and reading run in the background. Saving captures a "
"snapshot at operation start; new edits during it remain unsaved. External "
"changes require Reload, Save As, explicit overwrite, or Cancel. Normal "
"switching and closing prompt for unsaved changes."

msgid ""
"导出支持 SVG、透明 PNG 和 LaTeX 源码，可选当前、选中或全部公式，并指定倍率、DPI、目录与 ``{index}`` / "
"``{name}`` "
"命名模式。扩展名自动添加。每项记录独立成功或失败，取消保留已经完成的文件。每一项都绑定开始时的源码与设置；不会把旧预览导出成新公式。"
msgstr ""
"Export supports SVG, transparent PNG, and LaTeX source for the current, "
"selected, or all formulas, with scale, DPI, directory, and ``{index}`` / "
"``{name}`` naming patterns. Extensions are appended automatically. Each item"
" reports success/failure separately; cancellation retains completed files. "
"Every item binds its source and settings at start, so stale previews are "
"never exported as new formulas."

msgid "SVG 中的字形（含中文）转为实际曲线路径；接收方无需安装字体。预览、SVG、PNG 使用同一数学布局。后端与字体许可见 渲染实现与证据。"
msgstr ""
"SVG glyphs, including Chinese, are converted to actual curve paths, so "
"recipients need no installed fonts. Preview, SVG, and PNG share the same "
"mathematical layout. For backend and font licenses, see Rendering "
"Implementation and Evidence."

msgid ""
"首版限制：每文档 256 条公式、每条 64 KiB 源码、文档 16 MiB、嵌套 128 层；单边最多 16384 像素，总像素最多 "
"16777216。超限明确失败，不静默截断。"
msgstr ""
"First-version limits: 256 formulas per document, 64 KiB source per formula, "
"16 MiB documents, 128 nesting levels, 16384 pixels per side, and 16777216 "
"pixels total. Exceeding limits fails explicitly rather than silently "
"truncating."

msgid ""
"恢复副本每 60 秒保存一次已修改文档；异常结束后，下次启动可恢复为新文档。原路径仅作提示，恢复不会直接覆盖原文件。收藏也使用 "
"``.rmath``，独立于当前文档保存。"
msgstr ""
"Modified documents get recovery copies every 60 seconds. After unexpected "
"exit, the next launch can recover them as new documents. Original paths are "
"hints only; recovery never directly overwrites originals. Favorites also use"
" ``.rmath`` and are saved independently of the current document."

msgid ""
"文件布局与恢复契约见 :doc:`../userspace-api/reliefmath-format`； 渲染和命令范围见 "
":doc:`reliefmath-rendering`、:doc:`reliefmath-commands`。"
msgstr ""
"For file layout and recovery contracts, see :doc:`../userspace-"
"api/reliefmath-format`; for rendering and command scope, see "
":doc:`reliefmath-rendering` and :doc:`reliefmath-commands`."
